      "writtenOn": "2022-09-14T13:38:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I see. My understanding is that if the paint has a shader, we would need to use the shaded color here.\n\nSo I guess what I actually need to do is not take in a dest color here (which gets written as a uniform as it\u0027s implemented now) and instead just let the SkSL pass in the variable or value it wants as the dest into the blend_with_dest_provided snippet. Does that sound reasonable?",
